's a quiet and serene neighborhood.\",\n        \"It has become an important hub for contemporary art.\",\n        \"Its population is mostly from Asian countries.\",\n        \"The neighborhood primarily hosts sporting events.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 38,\n      \"question\": \"What can be inferred about the friends' experience at Jackson Heights?\"\n      \"options\": [\n        \"They were bored and wished they had stayed in Manhattan.\",\n        \"They enjoyed the diversity of cultures present in the neighborhood.\",\n        \"They found it too noisy and chaotic for their taste.\",\n        \"They only visited Jackson Heights because they were tired of Brooklyn.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\n      \"question\": \"What is the author's tone towards Brooklyn, Queens, and Long Island City?\"\n      \"options\": [\n        \"Neutral, as they didn't have strong feelings about any neighborhood.\",\n        \"Positive, expressing admiration for their artistic and cultural scenes.\",\n        \"Negative, criticizing the lack of attractions in some neighborhoods.\",\n        \"Skeptical, questioning whether visiting all three was a good idea.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"Which of the following statements best describes the friends' experience?\"\n      \"options\": [\n        \"They were uninterested in their surroundings and didn't enjoy their trip.\",\n        \"They found each neighborhood unique and worth visiting, with a mix of arts and culture.\",\n        \"Their trip was mainly about indulging in expensive restaurants and shopping.\",\n        \"They only enjoyed their time at Long Island City, dismissing the others as dull.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
